WEBVTT

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:25.900
How can I tell you this?

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:37.140
How can I tell you this?

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:47.580
I cannot touch you

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.230
But I...

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:58.630
...can kill you

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:05.540
I'm so sad to say to you...

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:10.600
...but don't put your face so close to me

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:16.050
Now I hear you say my name...

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:25.010
...so I cross the light to be with you

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:40.670
Firefly Light.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.310
Is there really a ghost here?

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:51.080
Someone in Class 3 got grabbed by his legs
and dragged into the washroom.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.320
He didn't come to school
for three days afterward.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.990
They say it's a scary woman ghost.

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:59.820
They could be talking about Miss Miyazaki.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.290
Stay away from here.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:09.700
Stay away, or I will haunt you for life.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.510
It's real!

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:13.910
It's a woman's ghost!

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:15.370
What?

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.710
You're wrong...

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:22.870
Now what?

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:31.410
Oh, no. It's a patrol.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.530
Wh-what?

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.590
No way!

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:51.140
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:00.350
What are you doing here?

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:02.980
Are you here on a dare too?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.220
You kids today are so hopeless.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.200
Oh, is that so? Yes, I'm just a kid...

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.030
...and no, I'm not here on a dare.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:13.930
Anyway, bye.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.430
W-wait a minute.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:19.100
What is it now?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.210
Um, actually...

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:24.280
...I have a favor to ask.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.780
What is it?

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.850
C-can you help me?

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:28.880
Pardon?

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.710
I got a little stuck and I can't get out.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.080
What, are you stupid?

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.120
Hurry.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.890
Don't rush me, it's really stuck.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.530
Is somebody there?

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:43.500
H-hurry!

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.760
I know!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.750
Hey! Where do you think you're touching me?!

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:10.420
What's the problem? There's nothing to touch.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:13.130
How rude!

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.590
What are you doing?!

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:15.730
What do you expect?!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.700
For an elementary school kid,
you have no manners.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.370
Oh, really? And are you in middle school?

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.830
That's right.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.200
I'm surprised you haven't developed.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:30.580
Hey, stop being so slap-happy!
I helped you out, didn't I?!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.910
Oh, yes. Thank you ever so much for that.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.410
That's rich, coming from someone
who wears teddy bear underwear.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.290
How do you know that?

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:41.020
Huh?

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:42.020
You peeked?

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:43.080
I did not.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:47.120
But you know that I'm wearing
teddy bear underwear!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.760
I didn't want to see them, but they
were right in my face, Sister.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:05:00.060
Uh, it's not like I'm trying to mock you.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:02.800
I'm sorry.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:07.740
That's okay. I'm not getting down
about having my underwear on display.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:16.860
Um, I'm Eko Miyazaki.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:18.480
I'm Kouta Seto.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:20.680
And this is Blue.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:25.630
Kouta! Thank God, I thought you got caught!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.370
We all just about got spotted.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.770
That's why I said that I didn't want to do the dare.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.740
But you can see them.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.980
See what?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.670
You know...

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.280
Who is she?

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.770
So, you are here on a dare.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:47.950
I already told you that I'm not, Sister.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.050
Hmph!

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.470
What's with her?

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:01.020
How should I know?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.800
Kouta?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.940
I heard a bell.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:10.380
What?

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.570
Oh...

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.040
Long time, no see.

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:19.450
Hey, you. My buddy had better
be in good health.

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:24.810
Sheesh. What are you doing over here?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.790
Someone has left a regret here.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:32.020
Momo is being a big busybody, as usual.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.930
Well, see you later.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.730
Kouta, who are you talking to?

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.930
A reaper.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.650
I'm home.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:50.080
You certainly were out late.
You don't have cram school today, do you?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.200
All you do is yawn, Eko.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:26.950
Actually, I tried to be a ghost yesterday.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:27.710
Huh?

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:31.020
I guess you could say it backfired,
it was a total flop.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:36.450
I'm not very smart, so it's the
only thing I could come up with.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.260
What are you talking about?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.330
I dunno what to do.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.380
Bye, Teacher!
Bye!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.050
Let's go!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.450
So, you're a teacher starting today.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:01.550
Yeah.

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:05.750
Your dream of becoming a teacher came true.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.380
I'm hopeless.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:12.190
I don't think I'll ever be chosen
to represent the archery team.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:15.230
Don't worry. I know you can do it.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:28.850
Yes?

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.420
Eko, want to go see the fireflies?

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.290
What?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.690
Sis told me something.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.530
What?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.860
She said there are as many fireflies
as there is happiness.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:56.640
She said it was because watching the fireflies
made her happy for some reason.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:03.010
She said that in elementary school,
she and her students kept and raised fireflies.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.810
Oh.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.980
Oh, it's you, Sis!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.430
Hello, it's me!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.760
Takashi Saiki!

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.960
We met at the elementary school with Kouta.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.690
Oh, yes. Saiki. Kouta's friend.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.500
That's right!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.870
Eko?

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:30.140
Uh, he's a friend of mine.
He goes to Wako's school.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.610
I know, I'll treat you to ice cream.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:34.510
Uh, sure.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.380
Don't tell anyone.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.720
Tell 'em what?

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.350
That we met at the school.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.520
Oh.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.360
You guys don't want anyone to know
you were there either, do you?

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.880
Well, yeah.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.560
And stop those dares.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.030
But they're saying there really is a ghost.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:58.900
It was a woman's ghost, saying
she would haunt them for life.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:01.540
That was me.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.840
Pardon?

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.270
Nothing.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:08.940
Besides, Kouta said he saw something.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:13.190
He says he started seeing ghosts...

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:16.310
...after his childhood friend, a girl,
passed away last year.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.650
He was serious.

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:22.460
He says he saw her spirit.

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.830
You're kidding.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.230
He says he spoke with her
and made her a promise.

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:31.240
He spoke with a ghost?

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:36.380
He also said he saw a reaper.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:38.210
A... A reaper?!

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:43.250
You must get frightened easily, Sis.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:49.420
Look...

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.350
Oh, thank you for treating me!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.950
No, that's not it.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.270
Over here, over here!
Hurry!

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:07.610
Pass it!
Aww...

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.230
Shake it off!

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.980
Kouta!

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:13.680
Yo.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.710
Hey, it's panty bear.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:16.650
What?!

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:18.320
No, I mean, um...

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.850
Eko.

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:21.590
What is it?

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.050
Can we talk?

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:26.460
Forget it.

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:27.860
Huh?

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.330
I'm playing soccer.

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:31.960
Just give her a minute.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:35.530
After all, she treated me to ice cream.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.630
What's that got to do with me?

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:47.140
Oh, fine. But just for a minute.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.350
So, what's up, Sister?

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.260
It feels kind of weird.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:58.760
Huh?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:01.190
Being called Sister.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.360
I was always the youngest.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:05.860
Wha-?

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.830
Uh, no, I mean...

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.670
Is it true that you can see ghosts, Kouta?

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.810
Yeah, it's true.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.240
What?!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.040
So what?

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.850
It's just, um...

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.290
Can you help me out?

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:27.890
Huh?

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.820
I need you to come with me
to the elementary school again...

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:34.330
You've heard the rumors, haven't you?

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:38.200
About a ghost that appears
at the school and causes mischief?

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.720
Yeah.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:42.730
The one they started the rumors about...

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:45.900
...is my big sister.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:50.600
Wow, so you're Miss Miyazaki's little sister?

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:52.680
Yeah.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:57.480
They've started a rumor that her ghost
is there making trouble.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:00.610
I couldn't stand it.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:05.550
That's why I dressed up as a ghost to try
to scare away the kids going there on dares.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:09.630
But it's having no effect...

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:12.120
...and it's even making it worse.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:17.100
If it's true that you can really see ghosts...

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:20.870
...could you prove to them that it isn't her ghost?

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.480
Forget it.

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.240
What?! Why not?!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.710
Haven't you considered that the ghost
really could be your big sister?

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.840
Wha-?!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:35.140
Ow! Stop slapping me!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:39.760
I will slap you for that, you idiot!
You shorty! You brat!

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:42.690
Be quiet, you old lady!
You panty bear! You flatty!

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:46.320
Forget it. Don't worry, because
I won't ask you for help again.

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.830
I'll do it, all by myself.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:52.430
Okay, have fun with that. Bye.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.750
Honestly, you should see yourself.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.830
But why?

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:25.960
I can see your bear underwear.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.230
Here.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.050
You really don't plan ahead, do you?

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:37.880
How were you planning to get in
if I hadn't come along?

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.220
It would work out somehow.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.920
I bet that when you were a kid...

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.980
...you just followed after your sister
without a thought in the world.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:49.600
This is it. I left it unlocked.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.590
We're going in through the window?

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:53.720
Everything else is locked.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:17.620
What is it?

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.860
Actually... I don't sense anything.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.960
What?

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.950
I think that means there is no ghost here.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.670
Really?

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.130
Really.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.770
Oh.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.870
You're disappointed that your
sister's ghost isn't here?

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.110
No...

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.550
Crap!

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:51.090
You heard a sound too, didn't you?

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.790
You must be imagining things.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:55.420
I'll have a look inside.

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.970
There's nobody here, see?

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:05.460
Right.

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:18.610
That was really close.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:24.090
We'll be spotted if we go out again,
so we should probably stay here for a while.

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:32.430
Why are you so hung up on ghosts?

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:33.770
What?

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:38.000
Oh, right. You're hung up
on your sister, not ghosts.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.610
I'm not hung up on her...

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:49.600
...there was something I couldn't say to her.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.140
Eko, what's gotten into you lately?

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:01.750
I'm coming in.

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:07.370
Your dream is still in progress.
It will all work out.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:10.100
You just have to keep trying.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:13.870
That's fine for you to say.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.600
What?

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:18.510
You're pretty, and you're good
at everything you do.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.110
Eko?

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:24.980
You don't know how I feel,
being constantly compared to you.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.650
But you're who you are.

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:29.450
Don't make it sound so simple!

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:35.790
I hate you.

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:40.760
I wish you would just disappear.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.340
The day I said that to her,
she got into an accident...

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:56.010
...and I haven't been able to smile since then.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:02.220
I want to smile because
my sister would always smile.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.290
I can understand.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:11.080
I vowed I would keep Mai
safe from harm, but I failed.

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:14.820
That's why I couldn't smile.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:19.800
Then I met the girl in white.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:22.470
Girl in white?

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:26.930
Yeah. She was so pristine and white,
and was such a crybaby...

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:31.210
Anyway, she let me see Mai.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:35.520
Is the person in white an angel?

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:39.850
An angel?

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.680
Let's get going.

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:58.580
What is it?

00:18:58.580 --> 00:18:59.810
Something's here.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.560
Hey...

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:27.630
YEAR 3
CLASS 2

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.940
This is my sister's class.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.490
Sis.

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:57.460
Sis...

00:19:58.540 --> 00:19:59.940
Sis!

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.840
Sis, I'm sorry.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.810
I'm so sorry I said that to you.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:14.690
I was jealous of you.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:18.820
You put me to shame... but I didn't hate you.

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:24.100
Sis, I don't like myself.

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:28.930
But I like myself for loving you.

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.330
It's true!

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.560
Thank you, Eko.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:18.780
I thought it was you.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.550
The moon is very pretty.

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:26.590
But the moon doesn't shine by itself.

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:31.560
It only reflects the light shining onto it,
yet it still shines so prettily.

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:34.060
Don't you find that mysterious?

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:38.570
Some shine when they reflect the light...

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:41.560
...and others become washed out
by the same light.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:44.980
You're talking nonsense as usual.

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:47.970
Hey, Human. Watch your mouth
when you speak to her.

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:53.050
I can see weird things thanks to you.

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:55.020
Oh, really? I'm sorry.

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.820
It's probably because I touched you.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.950
But don't worry. When you get older,
the visions will go away.

00:22:02.890 --> 00:22:04.430
Really?

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:06.690
Momo never lies.

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:09.070
Have a look.

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:18.340
The light that was washed out
has come back to her.

00:22:49.810 --> 00:22:55.440
Born out of a deep sleep...

00:22:55.980 --> 00:23:03.750
...I wonder why can't I stop crying?

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:12.830
A gentle breeze blows through my white hair...

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:20.000
...conveying each and every little word

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:30.620
Within my arms are so many lives...

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:38.040
...so fleetingly, so lovingly extinguished

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:46.900
They dance white and high into the night sky...

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:55.070
...and I keep watch over them, ever vigilant

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:01.980
Next Episode

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:02.580
We cannot see the wind that blows...

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.920
...but I can feel it through my hair.

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.990
I'm sure that souls are the same way.

00:24:06.990 --> 00:24:09.720
Next episode: "Journey of the Heart."

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:13.990
This is the sad and sweet story
of a Reaper in white.

00:24:11.990 --> 00:24:14.920
Journey of the Heart.
